ator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Fannin County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years. In 2025, September to October came in at 51% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 16635 had its driest year in 1963 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
